#: ConfigEditJson.qml:24
msgid ""
"Edit the menu structure as JSON. Each item can have: name, icon, command "
"(run through the shell) or action (a session action: lock, logout, leave, "
"switchUser, suspend, hibernate, reboot, shutdown), submenu (array of items), "
"or separator (true)."
msgstr ""
"Upravte štruktúru ponuky ako JSON. Každá položka môže mať: name, icon, "
"command (spustí sa cez shell) alebo action (akcia relácie: lock, logout, "
"leave, switchUser, suspend, hibernate, reboot, shutdown), submenu (pole "
"položiek) alebo separator (true)."

